			"widgets_values":[
				"For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] One continuous, realistic cooking shot in the kitchen. Begin exactly with Picture 1: the woman holds the wok handle with one hand and a metal spatula with the other, looking down at the vegetables cooking over the gas flame. The camera makes a slow, small push toward the wok and her face while keeping both in frame. She stirs the ingredients twice, then gives the wok one controlled forward flick; the vegetables rise only slightly and fall back into the pan. She continues stirring and gives a small, satisfied smile. Steam rises naturally into the range hood, the flame remains beneath the wok, and the warm kitchen light stays consistent. Preserve her face, ponytail, white sleeveless top, hand positions, utensils, and kitchen layout. Natural real-time movement, with no cuts, sudden zooms, exaggerated flames, or new people.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClear stir-frying sizzles, the light scrape of the spatula against the wok, the steady gas flame, and the soft range-hood hum. No dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
